  "ALL_TEXT": "84 INT. MINISTER'S HOUSE - DINGY ROOM - DAY\nThe FOREST MINISTER is seated, surrounded by his men. He has\nhis foot on CHINTHAN BABA, who sits on the floor, scared.\nFOREST MINISTER\nNaa kodakka, ninnu dabbulu petti\nbaba ni chesi, prasadaalu\nthesukuni, nee ashirwaadalu\nthesukuntey, naa kodaka malli\nnaakey goya thavuthavu ra\nCHINTHAN BABA\nAdi kaadu, vigraham ashramam lo ney\nundaali kani malli maayam\naypoyindhi, eh lopulo, nee\nmanushulu vachi kotti laakovachaaru\nFOREST MINISTER\nNaa dabbu kudaa nee manushuley\nmaarchaara...\nCHINTHAN BABA\nAemo andi\nFOREST MINISTER\n(angry)\nFake note-lu ela pettaavu raa\nnuvvu! Naa dabbu aedhi!?! fake\nnote-lu ela telikunda pettaaru?\nCHINTHAN BABA\nNijam chepthunnunaanu, kotta note\nlu ela untaayi kuda telidu naaku.\nNuvvu container pampinchav mee\nmanushule ah boxulu ni na vaibhoga\nNidrashala lo pettaaru.\nFOREST MINISTER\n(angry)\nPeru Vaibhoga Nidrashala okati,\nNuvvu Vaibhogam ga padukovadam\nvalle ee daridram. Motham anni fake\nnotule. Dorikithey na post udeydhi,\nkatakatalu lekapetalsochedhi.\nMotham Ashram ni thagalettesay mani\ncheppa.\nThe FOREST MINISTER pauses and thinks\nFOREST MINISTER\nNews lo vosthunna aa mugguru evaru?\nCHINTHAN BABA\nSULOCHANA na bhakthuraalu, monna\nkerichief esaanu kadaa aa\nammaaye...vaallu iddaru podhunna\njarigina aa murdurlu gurinchi\ncharchinchi na sahaayam pondha\ndaaniki vochaaru.\nFOREST MINISTER\nSahayam enti ra donga rascal,\npodhunna vaalle VASU ni RAJU ni\nchampesi ah car kalchesaru. Dhantlo\nkuda donga notlu kalipoyayi anta\nThe LEAD GOON chimes in\nLEAD GOON\nSir, veediki emi thelisinattu\nledhu. Vaalle sahayam peru tho\nvigrahaanni kuda kottesi\nunduntaaru.\nThe FOREST MINISTER thinks for a beat. His goons around him\nlooks anxiously.\nFOREST MINISTER\nSare oka pancheyandi, aa mugguru ni\ntrace cheyandi\nCUT TO:",
